    "status": "present",
    "value": "Construct any string containing exactly a copies of a and b copies of b without three equal consecutive letters. The approach is: prefer the more frequent remaining letter unless it would form a forbidden triple. Its target cost is O(a+b) time/O(a+b) output. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
